* Modelos básicos incluidos con Simulador múltiple (parámetros publicados por los fabricantes).
.model 1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=0.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=0.4 tt=20n Bv=100 Ibv=100u)
.model 1N4007 D(Is=7.02767n Rs=0.0341512 N=1.80803 Cjo=10p M=0.3 tt=100n Bv=1000 Ibv=5u)
.model LED_ROJO D(Is=93.2p Rs=42m N=3.73 Cjo=2.97p M=0.333 tt=4.32u Bv=5 Ibv=10u)
.model 2N2222 NPN(Is=14.34f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=74.03 Bf=255.9 Ne=1.307 Ise=14.34f Ikf=.2847 Xtb=1.5 Br=6.092
+ Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=1 Cjc=7.306p Mjc=.3416 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=22.01p Mje=.377 Vje=.75 Tr=46.91n Tf=411.1p
+ Itf=.6 Vtf=1.7 Xtf=3 Rb=10)
.model 2N3906 PNP(Is=1.41f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=18.7 Bf=180.7 Ne=1.5 Ise=0 Ikf=80m Xtb=1.5 Br=4.977 Nc=2
+ Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=2.5 Cjc=9.728p Mjc=.5776 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=8.063p Mje=.3677 Vje=.75 Tr=33.42n Tf=179.3p
+ Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=6 Rb=10)

* Temporizador 555 (modelo de comportamiento). Pines: GND TRIG OUT RESET CTRL THR DIS VCC
.subckt NE555 gnd trig out reset ctrl thr dis vcc
R1 vcc ctrl 5k
R2 ctrl lo 5k
R3 lo gnd 5k
Rq vcc gnd 3k
Bs s 0 V = v(trig) < v(lo) ? 1 : 0
Br r 0 V = (v(thr) > v(ctrl)) || (v(reset,gnd) < 0.7) ? 1 : 0
Bq q 0 V = (v(s) > 0.5) && (v(reset,gnd) >= 0.7) ? 1 : ((v(r) > 0.5) ? 0 : ((v(qd) > 0.5) ? 1 : 0))
Rd q qd 100
Cd qd 0 100p
Bo oi 0 V = v(qd) > 0.5 ? max(v(vcc) - 1.7, v(gnd)) : v(gnd) + 0.1
Vs oi o2 0
Ro o2 out 10
Bv vcc 0 I = max(i(Vs), 0)
Bg 0 gnd I = max(-i(Vs), 0)
Bk dk 0 V = v(qd) > 0.5 ? 0 : 1
S1 dis gnd dk 0 SW555
.model SW555 SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.1 RON=10 ROFF=100MEG)
.ends NE555

* Regulador de 5 V (modelo de comportamiento: necesita unos 2 V de margen). Pines: IN GND OUT
.subckt UA7805 in gnd out
Rq in gnd 2.4k
Bo oi 0 V = v(gnd) + max(min(5, v(in,gnd) - 2), 0)
Vs oi o2 0
Ro o2 out 0.05
Bi in gnd I = max(i(Vs), 0)
Bg 0 gnd I = max(i(Vs), 0)
.ends UA7805

* Amplificador operacional tipo 741 (ganancia 200000, 1 MHz, salida a 1,5 V de las alimentaciones).
* Pines en el orden del patillaje DIP-8: 2 IN-  3 IN+  4 V-  6 OUT  7 V+
.subckt UA741 inn inp vn out vp
Rin inp inn 2MEG
Rq vp vn 14k
Bg g 0 V = 2e5 * (v(inp) - v(inn))
Rp g g2 1k
Cp g2 0 31.8u
Bo oi 0 V = max(min(v(g2), v(vp) - 1.5), v(vn) + 1.5)
Vs oi o2 0
Ro o2 out 75
Bp vp 0 I = max(i(Vs), 0)
Bn 0 vn I = max(-i(Vs), 0)
.ends UA741

* Relé de 5 V (bobina de 70 ohmios; se activa a partir de unos 35 mA). Pines: COM A1 A2 NC NO
.subckt RELE_5V com a1 a2 nc no
Rc a1 m 70
Lc m m2 20m
Vs m2 a2 0
Bk k 0 V = abs(i(Vs)) > 0.035 ? 1 : 0
Rk k kd 100
Ck kd 0 1u
Bn kn 0 V = 1 - v(kd)
S1 com no kd 0 SWREL
S2 com nc kn 0 SWREL
.model SWREL SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.1 RON=0.05 ROFF=100MEG)
.ends RELE_5V
